# Compile and Test must each have their own avroGenerate cache.
# Before the fix, both used one shared Global cache. That caused:
# 1. Test/avroGenerate generates to compiled_avro/test and records those files in the cache.
# 2. Compile/avroGenerate checks the same cache, sees unchanged inputs and existing outputs,
#    and skips generation, so compiled_avro/main stays empty.

> Test/avroGenerate
> Compile/avroGenerate

# Compile's output exists only if it used its own cache.
$ exists target/compiled_avro/main/com/github/sbt/avro/test/Avsc.java
